What:		/sys/bus/platform/drivers/apple-isp/<dev>/sensor
Date:		November 2026
Contact:	Artyom Astafurov <artyom.astafurov@gmail.com>
Description:
		Read-only identifier of the detected built-in camera sensor
		module (for example "imx958-uw" or "imx558"), also reachable at
		/sys/class/video4linux/videoX/device/sensor. On hardware with
		deferred camera startup, reading this attribute before the
		first stream detects the camera fails with -ENODATA.
